### Health
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/health

### Create customer
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/customers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "eesa.sample@example.com",
  "full_name": "Eesa Sample"
}

### Register kit
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/kits/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "kit_code": "KIT-AB12CD34",
  "customer_id": 1
}

### Create processing job
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/processing-jobs
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "kit_id": 1,
  "pipeline_version": "v1"
}

### Mark processing succeeded
PATCH http://127.0.0.1:8000/processing-jobs/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "succeeded"
}

### Create report
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/reports
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "kit_id": 1,
  "report_version": "v1",
  "summary": "Synthetic wellness report generated for portfolio demonstration only."
}

### Dashboard
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/customers/1/dashboard
